Impact ADetailer
================

This extension is an independent project for Forge, ReForge and Forge Neo.

It reuses ideas and UI patterns from:

* [ADetailer](https://github.com/Bing-su/adetailer) (AGPL-3.0)
* [ADetailer-Neo](https://github.com/Haoming02/sd-forge-adetailer) (AGPL-3.0)
* [ComfyUI Impact Pack](https://github.com/ltdrdata/ComfyUI-Impact-Pack) FaceDetailer crop loop

Detection weights are not shipped. Ultralytics / Bingsu models keep their own licenses.
